<title>PORTUGAL: Somague, A.Silva e Silva suspended on Lisbon bourse.</title>
<headline>Somague, A.Silva e Silva suspended on Lisbon bourse.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares of Portuguese construction firms Somague and A. Silva e Silva on Lisbon bourse was suspended by the Financial Markets Committee, dealers said.</p>
<p>The reason for the suspension was not immediately known.</p>
</text>
